stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Discover
    Discover --> Request: select capability
    Request --> Review: submit requirements
    Review --> Enabled: approve and provision
    Review --> Rejected: deny with reason
    Enabled --> Active: first successful use
    Active --> Restricted: policy or incident
    Restricted --> Active: remediate
    Active --> Deprecated: replacement available
    Deprecated --> Retired: migration complete
    Retired --> [*]

